\item For \code{offers}, print every level on the sell side of the Infosys order book, best first.
\item For \code{offers}, compare the quantity offered with the quantity bid in the visible book, a rough measure of selling pressure.
\item For \code{best_bid}, print the highest bid for Infosys, or say that nobody is bidding.
