    A \code{data.frame} with one row per parent or order, holding \code{parent_id}, \code{order_id}, \code{broker}, \code{cancelled} and \code{error}, where \code{parent_id} is \code{NA} for an order cancelled on its own, \code{order_id} and \code{broker} are \code{NA} for a parent, and \code{error} is \code{NA} for a cancel that was accepted and the status and message of the failure otherwise, or \code{NULL} when nothing in this instrument is waiting.
