\subsection{\code{TradeableInstrument$parent_trades()}}{
  Today's trades in the broker orders that one of the order engine's parents placed.

The examples below, in order:
\itemize{
\item Show that a held limit buy has no trades, then cancel it.
\item Buy one Vodafone Idea share at once with a marketable limit as an intraday order, list the trades its parent made, which is \code{NULL} until the broker's trade book links them to the parent, and close the position again.
}
