    \describe{
      \item{\code{parent_id}}{The character \code{parent_id} that \code{place_order()} answered with.}
    }
    \if{html}{\out{</div>}}
  }
  \subsection{Details}{
    Errors: signals \code{BrokerError} when no broker's trade book could be read; \code{ServiceUnavailableError} when UBI's trade book document is missing or too old to serve; and another \code{UnifiedBrokerInterfaceError} subclass for any other failure reported by, or on the way to, UBI.
