\item Buy one Vodafone Idea share at the market as an intraday order, print the price it filled at, and close it again through \code{reduce_position()}, which UBI routes against the broker holding the position, until the position is back where it started.
\item Do the same round trip with a tag on the buy, so the order can be picked out of the order book later.
